## 11.3 Play cooldown

Prevent rewards from being generated repeatedly through rapid interaction.

A cooldown may be used for reward eligibility, but the user should still be able to enjoy harmless animations.

Do not display unnecessary cooldown timers unless the restriction affects the user.

