# 16. OPTIONAL COLLECTION AND SHOP

Include a simple collection area for toys, accessories, treats, and room decorations.

For the initial version, use an in-app collection with earned items.

Do not require real-money purchases.

The collection should show:

- Item name.
- Item category.
- Preview.
- Ownership status.
- Unlock requirement.
- Equip or place action.

Keep the feature secondary to the pet room.

