# 17. DAILY ROUTINE AND PROGRESS

Provide a lightweight overview of the user's day.

Do not build a complex analytics dashboard.

## 17.1 Daily overview

Display:

- Reminders completed.
- Upcoming reminders.
- Completed checklist items.
- Treats earned.
- Recent pet interaction.
- Optional daily progress summary.

Use a small number of meaningful indicators.

## 17.2 Completion feedback

When a user completes a reminder, show a subtle confirmation.

Example:

"One little thing done. Nice work!"

If several reminders are completed:

"You made time for a few good things today."

Avoid comparing the user's performance against other users.

## 17.3 Daily reset

Daily summaries should update according to the user's local timezone.

Reset daily completion summaries without resetting long-term progress.

Completed historical reminders must remain accessible when relevant.

