# 26. SAMPLE COMPLETE USER JOURNEY

Implement and verify this example journey.

### Day 1: Adoption

Alex opens PAWSE.

Alex selects a dog and names him Milo.

Alex enters their preferred name.

The room appears, and Milo greets Alex.

Alex adds three reminders:

- Drink water at 10:30 AM.
- Review today's tasks at 11:00 AM.
- Take a short break at 1:00 PM.

The reminders are saved.

Alex interacts with Milo and explores the room.

